  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters up to rank five are mortals, but rank six are immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        101
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A rank five facing rank six is a world apart, heaven and earth: rank five are mortals and rank six are immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        211
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reaching rank six is a qualitative change from mortal to immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        231
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among ten million Gu Masters, not even one might become an immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters at rank one to rank five all suffer the restraints of primeval essence. Only after going beyond mortal and becoming a Gu Immortal do they gain endless primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        341
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "endless-primeval-essence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mortal Gu Masters finish at rank five peak stage. Gu Immortals at rank six are beyond mortal, and becoming a Gu Immortal is only a new starting point. Immortal apertures of rank six and rank seven Gu Immortals are blessed lands. Green grape immortal essence at rank six forms in that aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        609
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "new-starting-point",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_aperture"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Every blessed land faces an earthly calamity every ten years and a heavenly tribulation every hundred years.",
      "chapters": [
        374
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "new-starting-point",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every ten years a rank six Gu Immortal must weather an earthly calamity, and every hundredth year that calamity rises instead to a heavenly tribulation. Three centuries and three such tribulations later, rank seven follows.",
      "chapters": [
        1097
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path-to-rank-seven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The cultivator class at this height is covered on Gu Immortal. Ascension itself is covered on immortal ascension. The wider ladder is covered on ranks and realms.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
